Feature: Moneyhub Integration and Delegated Bank Data Access
  As a donor
  I want to connect my bank accounts through Moneyhub and have my attorney view my transactions through the platform
  So that my attorney can oversee my finances without ever holding my banking credentials or tokens

  Background:
    Given the platform is running with Moneyhub sandbox credentials configured

