    Then I should receive an authorisation link to the bank's consent journey
    And a Moneyhub user should be provisioned and remembered for my account
    And a pending connection should be recorded against my account
    And the Moneyhub-user-created and connection-initiated events should appear in my audit log

  # Why: User provisioning is once-per-donor — the same Moneyhub user is reused for every later connection
