  # Why: Just-inside cache boundary — data fetched within the last 5 minutes is served from cache (Sequence 2)
  @boundary
  Scenario: Recently fetched financial data is served from the cache
    Given my transactions were last fetched from Moneyhub 4 minutes ago
    When I view my transactions
    Then I should see the cached transactions
    And no fresh data should be fetched from Moneyhub

  # Why: Just-outside cache boundary — stale cache triggers a fresh server-side fetch
  @boundary
  Scenario: Stale financial data is refreshed from Moneyhub before display
    Given my transactions were last fetched from Moneyhub 6 minutes ago
    When I view my transactions
    Then fresh data should be fetched from Moneyhub on my behalf
